        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Binion, Benny Binion\n- Companies: Binion's Horseshoe\n- Places: Dallas, Texas; Las Vegas, Nevada\n- Roles: businessman, casino magnate, gambling icon, mob boss\n\nFacts:\n- Benny Binion was born on November 20, 1904, and he became an American gambling icon and mob boss.\n- Jack Benny Binion was born on February 21, 1937, in Dallas, Texas, and he is an American businessman.\n- Benny Binion was Jack Binion's father and was a casino magnate.\n- Jack Binion worked for his father at Binion's Horseshoe, a casino and hotel in Las Vegas, Nevada.\n- Benny Binion died on December 25, 1989.",
